:: LaaB V0.03.06 

LaaB V0.03.06 "Social Menu Update" Change Log

=Social Menu=
-The Social Menu has been completely redesigned to improve readability and the information it provides. 
-Every Core Character now has a Character Page that displays a large amount of information. This information will update as your relationship with the characters grow.
-Model Viewers have been added for most characters in the Character Pages. Options for this will update for certain Quest Completions.
-The Social Cheats Menu has also been updated.

=Sex=
-"Lucas: Boning the Neighbor" now has 2 extra options for getting the Lube that will have difference consequences in the future. (Hint: Science & Clinic)
-Sex with Lucas now has 5 Climax Scenes for Repeatable Sex. (Note: Until Patch b, "Lucas: Boning the Neighbor" is not completable, so you are given the option to view Quest-Specific or Repeatable Climax Scenes.)

