-Thomas: Study Session

=Other Scenes/Content=
-A new possible outcome when Hugging Lucas in the School Hallway with High Social.
-A variation to the "Dad: Shopping Trip" Quest for when you are not wearing underwear.
-A handful of Child Hair Sprites, including Noah's, have been improved. (Thanks Koala!)
-Ethan's Avatar has been updated.

